group-head\"><h2>Breads</h2><span>Sold by the loaf</span></div><div class=\"menu-list\"><div class=\"menu-item\"><h3>Country Sourdough</h3><p class=\"desc\">36-hour ferment, crackly crust, tangy crumb.</p><span class=\"price\">$8</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"add\">Add to order</button></div><div class=\"menu-item\"><h3>Rustic White</h3><p class=\"desc\">Soft, pillowy and perfect for toast.</p><span class=\"price\">$7</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"add\">Add to order</button></div><div class=\"menu-item\"><h3>Seeded Spelt</h3><p class=\"desc\">Nutty spelt packed with sunflower and pumpkin seeds.</p><span class=\"price\">$9</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"add\">Add to order</button></div><div class=\"menu-item\"><h3>Rosemary Focaccia</h3><p class=\"desc\">Olive oil, sea salt and fresh rosemary.</p><span class=\"price\">$7.50</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"add\">Add to order</button></div><div class=\"menu-item\"><h3>Walnut Rye</h3><p class=\"desc\">Dark, hearty and dotted with toasted walnuts.</p><span class=\"price\">$9</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"add\">Add to order</button></div><div class=\"menu-item\"><h3>Small Loaf</h3><p class=\"desc\">A little sourdough for one (or two).</p><span class=\"price\">$5</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"add\">Add to order</button></div></div></div><div class=\"menu-group\" data-reveal=\"true\"><div class=\"menu-group-head\"><h2>Pastries</h2><span>Baked fresh each morning</span></div><div class=\"menu-list\"><div class=\"menu-item\"><h3>Butter Croissant</h3><p class=\"desc\">Flaky, golden layers of cultured butter.</p><span class=\"price\">$4.50</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"add\">Add to order</button></div><div class=\"menu-item\"><h3>Almond Croissant</h3><p class=\"desc\">Filled with almond cream, topped with toasted flakes.</p><span class=\"price\">$5.50</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"add\">Add to order</button></div><div class=\"menu-item\"><h3>Berry Danish</h3><p class=\"desc\">Vanilla custard and seasonal berries.</p><span class=\"price\">$6</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"add\">Add to order</button></div><div class=\"menu-item\"><h3>Cinnamon Roll</h3><p class=\"desc\">Soft swirl, brown sugar and cream cheese glaze.</p><span class=\"price\">$5</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"add\">Add to order</button></div><div class=\"menu-item\"><h3>Blueberry Muffin</h3><p class=\"desc\">Bursting with berries and a crumbly top.</p><span class=\"price\">$4</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"add\">Add to order</button></div><div class=\"menu-item\"><h3>Morning Bun</h3><p class=\"desc\">Our signature cinnamon-sugar swirl.</p><span class=\"price\">$4.50</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"add\">Add to order</button></div></div></div><div class=\"menu-group\" data-reveal=\"true\"><div class=\"menu-group-head\"><h2>Cakes &amp; sweets</h2><span>Whole cakes by order</span></div><div class=\"menu-list\"><div class=\"menu-item\"><h3>Vanilla Bean Cake</h3><p class=\"desc\">Light sponge, real vanilla buttercream.</p><span class=\"price\">$38</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"add\">Add to order</button></div><div class=\"menu-item\"><h3>Chocolate Fudge Cake</h3><p class=\"desc\">Rich, dark and deeply chocolatey.</p><span class=\"price\">$42</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"add\">Add to order</button></div><div class=\"menu-item\"><h3>Lemon Drizzle Loaf</h3><p class=\"desc\">Bright lemon and a sweet, sticky glaze.</p><span class=\"price\">$22</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"add\">Add to order</button></div><div class=\"menu-item\"><h3>Cookie Box</h3><p class=\"desc\">Six cookies — ask for today's flavours.</p><span class=\"price\">$18</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"add\">Add to order</button></div></div></div><div class=\"menu-group\" data-reveal=\"true\"><div class=\"menu-group-head\"><h2>Coffee &amp; drinks</h2><span>Perfect with a pastry</span></div><div class=\"menu-list\"><div class=\"menu-item\"><h3>Espresso</h3><p class=\"desc\">A double shot of our house blend.</p><span class=\"price\">$3</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"add\">Add to order</button></div><div class=\"menu-item\"><h3>Cappuccino</h3><p class=\"desc\">Espresso with silky steamed milk.</p><span class=\"price\">$4.50</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"add\">Add to order</button></div><div class=\"menu-item\"><h3>Flat White</h3><p class=\"desc\">Strong, smooth and just the right size.</p><span class=\"price\">$4.50</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"add\">Add to order</button></div><div class=\"menu-item\"><h3>Hot Chocolate</h3><p class=\"desc\">Real chocolate, whipped cream on top.</p><span class=\"price\">$5</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"add\">Add to order</button></div></div></div><div class=\"menu-note\" data-reveal=\"true\"><div><h3>Ready to order?</h3><p>Add anything above, then head to your order to choose a pickup time.</p></div><a class=\"btn btn--primary\" href=\"order.html\">Review your order</a></div><div class=\"menu-note\" data-reveal=\"true\" style=\"margin-top: 22px;\"><div><h3>Looking for something special?</h3><p>We make celebration cakes, party platters and custom bakes. Get in touch and we'll sort it out.</p></div><a class=\"btn btn--outline\" href=\"visit.html#contact\">Ask us about catering</a></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"footer-grid\"><div class=\"footer-col\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"index.html\" aria-label=\"Hearth and Crumb home\"><span class=\"brand-mark\"><svg class=\"art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#art-wheat\"></use></svg></span><span class=\"brand-name\">Hearth &amp; Crumb<span class=\"brand-sub\">Bakery · Est. 2012</span></span></a><p style=\"margin-top: 18px; max-width: 32ch;\">Small-batch bread, pastry and cakes, baked fresh every morning in the heart of the neighbourhood.</p></div><div class=\"footer-col\"><h4>Explore</h4><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a><a href=\"menu.html\">Menu</a><a href=\"order.html\">Order</a><a href=\"about.html\">Our Story</a><a href=\"visit.html\">Visit Us</a></div><div class=\"footer-col\"><h4>Visit</h4><p>18 Willow Lane<br>Old town</p><p>Open daily<br>7am – 5pm</p></div><div class=\"footer-col\"><h4>A little note from us</h4><p>Get word of the weekend bakes and the occasional free pastry.</p><form class=\"newsletter\"><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Your email address\" aria-label=\"Email address\" required=\"\"><button class=\"btn btn--light btn--small\" type=\"submit\">Join</button><div class=\"form-message\">Thanks! You're on the list.</div></form></div></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>© 2026 Hearth &amp; Crumb Bakery. Made with flour and love.</span><span>Baked fresh, every single day.</span></div></div></footer><div class=\"toast\" role=\"status\">✓ Country Sourdough added to your order</div></div>\n\n\n</body></html>",
